<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu Business - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu Business - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 81.07		vs	   77.51</p>
<p> Operating	    1.23		vs	    1.14</p>
<p> Current		1.47		vs	    1.47</p>
<p> Net		  535    million    vs	  591    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.21 yen	  vs	   22.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  26 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujitsu Business Systems Ltd is a top information equipment dealer.</p>
</text>
